### 16. Logout User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Try to use token after logout (should still work - JWT limitation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/71/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Try to logout without token (Should fail 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/logout

### Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User State
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/state
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search Papers
POST {{baseUrl}}/papers/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "deep learning medical imaging",
  "limit": 10
}




### Get Recommendations (requires paper data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "user_id": 71,
  "count": 5,
  "model_preference": "specter",
  "session_id": "test-session-alpha-001"
}

### Track Interaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/interactions?user_id=71
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"paper_id":"698baad0cc98285b33e204c74e463e3840a64294",
"interaction_type":"save",
"context":{"source":"search",
"session_id":"test-session-alpha-001"}
}





### Track Interaction
GET {{baseUrl}}/interactions/saved?user_id=2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}







### 1. Get Full Citation Network (Depth 1, 50 nodes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/graph/citation-network/c8b25fab5608c3e033d34b4483ec47e68ba109b7?depth=1&max_nodes=50&include_metadata=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### ==============================================
### CITATION GRAPH ENDPOINTS - DUAL MODEL SUPPORT
### ==============================================

### 1. Get Citation Network (Default Model - from config)
GET {{baseUrl}}/graph/citation-network/61827838932597591901992a4d3a86b71b42ac69?depth=1&max_nodes=50&include_metadata=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Get Citation Network (Explicit MiniLM Model)
GET {{baseUrl}}/graph/citation-network/61827838932597591901992a4d3a86b71b42ac69?depth=1&max_nodes=50&embedding_model=minilm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Get Citation Network (SPECTER Model)
GET {{baseUrl}}/graph/citation-network/61827838932597591901992a4d3a86b71b42ac69?depth=1&max_nodes=50&embedding_model=specter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Compare Models - MiniLM vs SPECTER (Same Paper)
### Run both and compare semantic nodes
GET {{baseUrl}}/graph/citation-network/c8b25fab5608c3e033d34b4483ec47e68ba109b7?embedding_model=minilm&max_nodes=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/graph/citation-network/c8b25fab5608c3e033d34b4483ec47e68ba109b7?embedding_model=specter&max_nodes=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Get Graph Summary (Quick Stats)
GET {{baseUrl}}/graph/summary/61827838932597591901992a4d3a86b71b42ac69
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

